Third-party material
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

`third_party/external-snapshotter-v8.2.0/` holds the VolumeSnapshot CRDs and
the snapshot-controller manifests of kubernetes-csi/external-snapshotter v8.2.0
(Apache-2.0, https://github.com/kubernetes-csi/external-snapshotter), with that
project's LICENSE next to them and one image tag changed (see its README). The
end-to-end tests install them; the chart does not ship them.

The Go modules in `go.mod` are fetched at build time and are not vendored here.
The operator and hostprep binaries in the published images are built from them,
each under its own license.

`CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md` is the Contributor Covenant v2.1, reproduced verbatim apart
from the reporting contact. It is licensed CC BY 4.0 by its authors
(https://www.contributor-covenant.org), not under this repository's license.


